      "content": "GREAT GADDESDEN        GADDESDEN ROW TL 01 SW                                         (South side)                                         Jockey End 3/88                                    Woodview Cottage - GV                                      II House. C17, W part and single-storey extension at E later C20. Timber frame exposed on 1st floor, infill panels and casing to ground floor in painted brick.  Steep old red tile roof, W end half-hipped. A long 1 1/2-storeys house, set back from road, facing N, with gabled tiled porch off-centre. 3 gabled dormers at front eaves and 4 windows to ground floor. Casement windows. Garage doors occupy the lower part of the W part. Plank door to entrance. Before C20 extensions a 3-cells house of 3 structural bays with internal chimney a third from E end and entrance a third from W end, with external gable chimney to W. Jowled posts, heavy beamed  floor  structure;   clasped-purlin  roof  with  collar  and multiple-strut truss in E gable. Listing NGR: TL0400613660"
    }
  ],
